  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $ABD$에서 $\\angle A = 60^\\circ$, $\\overline{AB} = 5\\text{ cm}$이므로 $$\\overline{BD} = \\overline{AB}\\tan 60^\\circ = 5\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (cm)}$$ 따라서 $\\triangle ABD$의 넓이는 $$\\triangle ABD = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\times 5 \\times 5\\sqrt{3} = \\dfrac{25\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\text{ (cm}^2\\text{)}$$ $\\triangle BCD$에서 $\\overline{BD} = 5\\sqrt{3}\\text{ cm}$, $\\overline{CD} = 8\\text{ cm}$, $\\angle CDB = 30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\triangle BCD = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\times 5\\sqrt{3} \\times 8 \\times \\sin 30^\\circ = 20\\sqrt{3} \\times \\dfrac{1}{2} = 10\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (cm}^2\\text{)}$$ 따라서 $\\square ABCD$의 넓이는 $$\\dfrac{25\\sqrt{3}}{2} + 10\\sqrt{3} = \\dfrac{45\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\text{ (cm}^2\\text{)}$$"
